            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilkor 5.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oo doi pee idung'oki olalashe lino enkiguana? Oo, pee imen olalashe lino? Amu kintashe ake pooki te dukuya olorika le Nkai le nkiguana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 45.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " amu etisiraki aajo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mibatat olalashe lino",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emikintoki naa aadung'okino enkiguana ae kata olikae o likae, kake ematumut aajo mikipikaki aekata iyiook likae alashe entoki narror anaa ae bae narruesh ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayiolo nanu naaitijing'ayioki sii ti atua Olaitoriani Yesu nchere meetae entoki naiduruk te kewan enye; kake eiduruk entoki te pooki ng'ae ojo eiduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te naa keitarru olalashe lino entoki ninosita iyie, nemeekure ilotie iyie enyorrata. Mincho ake ina toki ninya eaku ninye nabatat obo otanang'a Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku mincho esupat te iyie eimakini aajo torrono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore enkitoria e Nkai mme endaata o eokore kake esupatisho o eseriani o eng'ida naaing'uaa Enkiyang'et Sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oisiaai Kristo aiko neijia neng'amunoyu te Nkai nenyorrarri sii too ltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ematusuj naa ina nayau eseriani o enchetunoto nashetu olikae olikae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emintarruoo esiaai e Nkai te nkaraki endaa. Kesinya pooki toki, kake torrono te neaku kebatat oltung'ani ilkulikae te ntoki nanya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enaikash te nemenya oltung'ani nkiri aashu eok enaisho oo sabibu aashu ae ake bae nabatat likae alashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkirukoto niata, tagolie te kewan o te Nkai. Emayiana ilo lemeeta ai naiguanare te kewan te nena naatonyorrayie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ilo oata ilng'ashi eidipaki aatudung'oki enkiguana, te nenya, amu mme te nkirukoto etaasa ina; amu ore pooki neme enkirukoto eing'uaa naa eng'oki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
